			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n## [1.1.0] - 2025-01-15\n\n### Added\n- **Tooltips**: Added tooltips for better user guidance.\n- **Dynamic Button Width**: Implemented dynamic button width calculation for better UI adaptability.\n- **Enhanced Scanning**: Improved port scanning functionality with progress updates and enhanced validation.\n  \n### Improved\n- **UI Handling**: Improved handling of UI updates and status messages during scanning.\n- **Server Buttons**: Enhanced rendering of server buttons based on scanning results.\n- **Screen Resizing**: Fixed issues related to resizing the screen and maintaining the state of text fields and server buttons.\n\n### Fixed\n- **Warnings**: Removed various warnings from the codebase."
		},
